Name: bf
noteType: bf
texture: pNotes2i
noAnimation: true
alpha: 0
mustPressIgnored: true
editorName: "Boyfriend (bf) - Custom"
engineCompatibility:
  - p-slice: "1.0.4"
description: |
  Invisible custom note that triggers Boyfriend's animation when its strumTime passes.
  Use this in charts where you want BF to auto-animate without rendering a visible note in-game.

# Usage
# 1. Place this file in `custom_notetypes/` inside your mod directory (already here).
# 2. In the Chart Editor, select a note and set its noteType to `bf` (some editors show a dropdown or require editing the note's properties).
# 3. The supplied `bf.lua` in this folder handles the runtime behavior (already present in the repo).

# Notes
# - P-slice 1.0.4 may require a manual registration step in the engine to expose custom note types to the Chart Editor (see bf_editor_instructions.md).
# - If the editor does not list the new note type, you can open the chart file in a text editor and change the note's `noteType` property to `bf` manually.
